#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The DDP is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @soclib: Social Capitalism and Pacifism shall be our primary goals.
- @unionist: We must work with the white collar unions to improve the lives of the middle class.
- @socrep: Following Friederich Naumann, we should champion both capitalism and progressivism.
- @liberal: We will return to the Classical Liberalism of the 19th century, prioritizing free market reforms.
- @industrial: German Industry and business must be defended at all costs. 
- @easy_discard

@soclib
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "soclib") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "soclib"; soclib_strength += 10; soclib_dissent -= 10; liberal_dissent += 10; z_relation -= 3; dvp_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; uspd_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 5

The left of our party supports this course, hoping to further cooperation with the SPD.

@unionist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "unionist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "unionist"; unionist_strength += 10; unionist_dissent -= 10

The Unionists support our continued commitment to middle class interests, hopefully we can fulfill their demands

@socrep
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "socrep") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "socrep"; socrep_strength += 10; wtb_support += 1; socrep_dissent -= 10; liberal_dissent -= 5; soclib_dissent -= 5; kpd_relation -= 3

The Social Republicans seek to continue the parties course down the middle road, compromising betweeen both the Classical Liberals and Social Liberals.

@liberal
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "liberal") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "liberal"; liberal_strength += 10; liberal_dissent -= 10; soclib_dissent += 10; z_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; ddp_relation -= 5; uspd_relation -= 5; kpd_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1

The Liberal wing of the party wants to guide the party toward the center of German politics, aligning closely with the DVP.

@industrial
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "industrial") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "industrial"; industrial_strength += 5; industrial_dissent -= 10; soclib_dissent += 10; ddp_relation -= 5; uspd_relation -= 5; kpd_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1

The Industrialists will attempt to guide the party towards protecting their interests, using their personal wealth as a bargaining tool.
@changed
on-arrival: soclib_dissent += 5; unionist_dissent += 5; socrep_dissent += 5; liberal_dissent += 5; industrial_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
